[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mC — hybrid (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mEvent log as source of truth, plus a small per-user read/dismiss table. Re-derivable history with per-item dismiss.
[39m  [38;5;246m2.[39m B — event log only
     [38;5;246mPure derived notifications with a read cursor. Smallest v1; mark-all-read only, per-item dismiss added later.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m A — materialized rows
     [38;5;246mFan out a notification row per subscriber on write. Simplest to reason about, but costly to change subscription [39m
     [38;5;246mrules later.[39m
